be personalized for any wishes within reason. The ceremony is often led by a member of the family. Upon request we can provide a list of common prayers, eulogies, songs, etc. Many of our captains have experience as a memorial at sea officiant. Please inquire if you would like the ceremony to be led by the captain / an officiant.\n\nPhotography options and recording the GPS coordinates of exact scattering location is available with every service.\n\n##What to Bring\n- Bring appropriate attire and footwear\n- Sunscreen \n- Rain jacket based on the weather forecast", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "#We look forward to having you!\n\n##What to Bring\n- Bring appropriate attire and footwear\n- Sunscreen \n- Rain jacket based on the weather forecast\n\n##Permits & Approvals: \nAll permits and approvals are covered, making the event streamlined and stress free.  This includes filing the required report with the EPA when the service is done at sea.\n\n\n##Prohibited \nNo Balloon release, because of the threat to wildlife.  Wreathes must be biodegradable, flowers must be real, no strings or wires. Clothing items are not permitted.", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "All Ages • Two Hours • Up to 25 Guests", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/teraloom/items/367212/images/723451/", "pk": 723451, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/OORvPSq0RZOR5geN70WI", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/OORvPSq0RZOR5geN70WI", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/teraloom/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/teraloom/items/367212/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/OORvPSq0RZOR5geN70WI", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.c